{"id": "c25c80eb-4f3b-4022-aada-93c1162e98c3", "slug": "nexus-interface", "title": "Nexus Interface", "description": "Interface Synchronize UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus Interface\"\ndescription: \"Interface Synchronize UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F97316\"\n  secondary: \"#E4E2DD\"\n  accent: \"#D97706\"\n  background: \"#E4E2DD\"\n  surface: \"#2C1D11\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"32px\"\n  control: \"31px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 364; favorites: 27; remixes: 15.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, dither, navigation, links.\n## Overview\nInterface Synchronize UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nNexus Architecture Primitives Changelog Deploy Platform Live v5.2 Synchronize decentralized networks with absolute precision. A singular command center to deploy, monitor, and scale global systems. Equip your engineers…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Synchronize decentralized networks with absolute precision.; The ultimate foundation for network routing; Deploy machine learning — with absolute zero friction.; Nexus.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F97316, secondary #E4E2DD, accent #D97706, background #E4E2DD, surface #2C1D11, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#E4E2DD] min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans text-slate-900 antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-orange-500 selection:text-white font-light\">\n\n    <!-- ASCII Dither Background -->\n    <div data-ascii-dither-bg aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:auto;height:100vh;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden\"></div>\n    <script src=\"https://api.asc11.com/storage/v1/object/public/published-scripts/exports/20260311125908409-9cd61b31-ascii-dither-background.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Pill-shaped Centered Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-50 rounded-full p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/60 via-slate-300/40 to-slate-400/20 shadow-sm gs-fade\">\n        <div class=\"bg-[#E4E2DD]/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-8\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(249,115,22,0.6)]\"></div>\n                Nexus\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-5\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-wide text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Architecture</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-wide text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Primitives</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-wide text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Changelog</a>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-md\">\n                Deploy\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <main class=\"relative w-full flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center pt-32 pb-20 z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Hero Outer Container wrapper with Lines -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8\">\n\n            <!-- Vertical Container Lines -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-4 md:left-8 w-px bg-slate-300/70 z-0 hidden sm:block pointer-events-none mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-4 md:right-8 w-px bg-slate-300/70 z-0 hidden sm:block pointer-events-none mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Mini Corner Squares -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-4 md:left-8 -ml-[3px] -mt-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#E4E2DD] border border-slate-400 hidden sm:block z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-4 md:right-8 -mr-[3px] -mt-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#E4E2DD] border border-slate-400 hidden sm:block z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-4 md:left-8 -ml-[3px] -mb-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#E4E2DD] border border-slate-400 hidden sm:block z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-4 md:right-8 -mr-[3px] -mb-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#E4E2DD] border border-slate-400 hidden sm:block z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Hero Text Section -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16 pt-8 md:pt-16\">\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-200/50 border border-slate-300/60 mb-8 gs-fade shadow-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-700 uppercase\">Platform Live v5.2</span>\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-light tracking-tighter text-slate-900 leading-[1.05] mb-6 gs-reveal-text\">\n                    Synchronize decentralized networks with absolute precision.\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto gs-fade leading-relaxed\">\n                    A singular command center to deploy, monitor, and scale global systems. Equip your engineers with instant analytics and automated resource allocation.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Main Features Grid -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative z-10\">\n\n                <!-- Card 1: Core Relay (Canvas Animation) -->\n                <div class=\"gs-card w-full aspect-[9/14] max-h-[580px] rounded-[32px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/30 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-2xl group\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[31px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col\">\n                        <!-- Canvas Background -->\n                        <canvas id=\"engine-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-70 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/40 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Header -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-white/80\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-orange-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-wide\">Nexus.io</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Floating Pill with Border Gradient -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-[25%] mx-auto w-[85%] gs-pill rounded-[28px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-xl\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[27px] p-5 flex justify-between items-center\">\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/50 mb-0.5 tracking-wide\">Core Relay</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm text-white font-light tracking-tight\">Launch Node</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors border border-white/10\" aria-label=\"Add Node\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" class=\"text-white text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Bottom Text -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto p-8 pb-10\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-white font-light\">\n                                <span class=\"text-white/50\">The ultimate foundation</span><br/>\n                                for network routing\n                            </h2>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2: AI ML Workflows -->\n                <div class=\"gs-card w-full aspect-[9/14] max-h-[580px] rounded-[32px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-black/10 via-black/5 to-transparent shadow-xl\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-[#FAFAFA] rounded-[31px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col\">\n                        <!-- Blurry Blob Background -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-[20%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[120%] h-[60%] bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-400 via-orange-500 to-red-600 rounded-full blur-[80px] opacity-[0.35] gs-blob mix-blend-multiply pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Header -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-slate-800\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-orange-600\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-wide\">Nexus.io</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Input Pill -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto mb-[20%] mx-auto w-[90%] rounded-[24px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-white/10 to-transparent shadow-2xl gs-pill\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#171717] rounded-[23px] p-2 pl-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 w-full overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magic-stick-3-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm flex-shrink-0\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 truncate w-full pointer-events-none font-light\">Synthesize neural algorithms...</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <button class=\"w-10 h-10 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors ml-2\" aria-label=\"Send\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:plain-2-linear\" class=\"text-white text-sm -rotate-45\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Bottom Text -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto p-8 pb-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#FAFAFA] via-[#FAFAFA]/95 to-transparent\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-slate-500 font-light\">\n                                Deploy machine learning —<br/>\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-900\">with absolute zero friction.</span>\n                            </h2>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3: Metrics Dark -->\n                <div class=\"gs-card w-full aspect-[9/14] max-h-[580px] rounded-[32px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent shadow-2xl\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-[#050505] rounded-[31px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center\">\n                        <!-- SVG Geometric Background -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-70 scale-[1.3] pointer-events-none\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-[140%] h-auto drop-shadow-2xl\">\n                                <path fill=\"#2C1D11\" d=\"M100 0 C100 55 145 100 200 100 C145 100 100 145 100 200 C100 145 55 100 0 100 C55 100 100 55 100 0 Z\" />\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Header -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-white/80\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-orange-700\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-wide\">Nexus.io</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Controls Pill -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto mb-16 mx-auto w-[85%] rounded-[32px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent shadow-2xl gs-pill\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1A]/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[31px] p-5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                <button class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white transition-colors p-2\" aria-label=\"Decrease\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </button>\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40 mb-1 font-light\">Network Bandwidth</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xl text-white font-light tracking-tight\">9.2 PB/s</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <button class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white transition-colors p-2\" aria-label=\"Increase\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-up-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Bottom Text Logo -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-0 right-0 text-center z-10 px-8 pointer-events-none\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-light tracking-tighter text-white leading-none\">Nexus</h3>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // WebGL / Canvas Line Animation (Card 1)\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('engine-canvas');\n        if (canvas) {\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let width, height, time = 0;\n\n            function resize() {\n                width = canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth;\n                height = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight;\n            }\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            function draw() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n                const lines = 12;\n                for(let i = 0; i < lines; i++) {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    const yOffset = (height / lines) * i;\n                    for(let x = 0; x <= width; x += 5) {\n                        const y = yOffset + Math.sin(x * 0.01 + time + i) * 30 * Math.sin(time * 0.5 + i * 0.1);\n                        if(x === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y);\n                        else ctx.lineTo(x, y);\n                    }\n                    const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, width, 0);\n                    grad.addColorStop(0, `rgba(217, 119, 6, ${0.1 + (i/lines)*0.4})`);\n                    grad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');\n\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = grad;\n                    ctx.lineWidth = 1.5 + (i % 3);\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                }\n                time += 0.025;\n                requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n            }\n            draw();\n        }\n\n        // GSAP Animations with ScrollTrigger\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Masked Staggered Word Reveal for Hero Title\n            const titleEl = document.querySelector('.gs-reveal-text');\n            if (titleEl) {\n                const words = titleEl.innerText.split(' ');\n                titleEl.innerHTML = '';\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    const wrap = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrap.style.cssText = 'overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; vertical-align: bottom; margin-right: 0.25em; padding-bottom: 0.1em; margin-bottom: -0.1em;';\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'gs-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]';\n                    inner.innerText = word;\n                    wrap.appendChild(inner);\n                    titleEl.appendChild(wrap);\n                });\n\n                gsap.to('.gs-word', {\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: titleEl,\n                        start: \"top 90%\"\n                    },\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 1.1,\n                    stagger: 0.04,\n                    ease: 'power4.out'\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Fade animations for subtitles and navigation\n            gsap.from(\".gs-fade\", {\n                y: 20,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.2,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.5\n            });\n\n            // Card grid timeline\n            const cardTl = gsap.timeline({\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".gs-card\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\"\n                }\n            });\n\n            cardTl.from(\".gs-card\", {\n                y: 60,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power3.out\"\n            })\n            .from(\".gs-pill\", {\n                scale: 0.9,\n                y: 20,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"back.out(1.5)\"\n            }, \"-=0.8\");\n\n            // Ambient Blob animation\n            gsap.to(\".gs-blob\", {\n                y: \"-30px\",\n                x: \"15px\",\n                scale: 1.05,\n                duration: 6,\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-interface.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-interface.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-interface-DESIGN.md", "views": 929, "forks": 32, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T13:20:53.905634+00:00"}